    "description": "Name of the vibration permission, which the app does not need"
  },
  "helpPermVibrationDesc": "Scan vibrations use Android's built-in touch feedback, which needs no permission.",
  "@helpPermVibrationDesc": {
    "description": "Explains that scan vibration needs no permission"
  },
