    "description": "Section heading: how to use the Scan bubble"
  },
  "helpGuideScanBubbleUseBullet1": "Turn it on in Settings > Scan bubble, from the Scan bubble tile in Quick Settings, or by long-pressing the app icon.",
  "@helpGuideScanBubbleUseBullet1": {
    "description": "Scan bubble: the ways to turn it on"
